rop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7168c2a3187795b810ba1fa268e8dfd3 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/43d91aee/uploads/origins/e77debe2-7253-4dbd-b1ea-d62b18e168a1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=292092638393e381252ab883b532d3d9", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/43d91aee/uploads/origins/e77debe2-7253-4dbd-b1ea-d62b18e168a1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=292092638393e381252ab883b532d3d9, https://si.imgix.net/43d91aee/uploads/origins/e77debe2-7253-4dbd-b1ea-d62b18e168a1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=431cc1d0dc2c41e19ebb27683738c436 2x, https://si.imgix.net/43d91aee/uploads/origins/e77debe2-7253-4dbd-b1ea-d62b18e168a1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3f1a2d06173f7857d644be5dfac60642 3x"}, "body": "Good evening, Ameko!\nI would like to ask you to draw an illustration of a character created in a TRPG. I would be very happy if you could draw two people at the seaside as an image. ...... (If you have any other ideas, I'd love to see them too!)\n\n\u26ab\ufe0eKira Mirume (15) female\nMaterial: https://x.com/toricuntori/status/1687034609396281350?s=46\nCheerful/ bright/ powerful\n\nBorn and raised on an island, 15 years old.\nLoves sparkling things, enjoys finding stained glass and large seashells at the beach\nWatamoto-san found her washed up on the beach one day\n\n\u26ab\ufe0e Rei Watamoto (25) male\n\nMaterial https://x.com/hannhuuki/status/1691467725271666689\ncheerful/ smiling (calm)/ kind\n\nUsually works as a salesman\nKind and basically devoted\nHe is the type of person who will intervene when there is a fight.\nOne day, he was found by Kira when he was washed up on the beach\n\n\u2192How do they feel about each other?\nMirume Kira recognizes Rei Watamoto as the one whom she likes, including romantic feelings, and is the only sparkling and important person for her.\nRei Watamoto thinks of Mirume Kira as a cute niece. She seems to be a teacher who was confessed by a kindergarten student in a sense.\n\nOverview of the TRPG that passed (jump to BOOTH). No spoilers if you just follow the link and read the summary)\n\nhttps://booth.pm/ja/items/1712065\n\nI've written a lot of settings, but I'd be happy if you could depict the two in your interpretation of Ameko-san! Thank you very much.", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@nanmoneena/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1693189, "client_id": 1853178, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/74a0c2eb/uploads/origins/318d2c77-a0c0-4693-a783-ce67d35d7cbf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=18ab4ca4f64ff824af04afd0c1e539ce", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/74a0c2eb/uploads/origins/318d2c77-a0c0-4693-a783-ce67d35d7cbf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=18ab4ca4f64ff824af04afd0c1e539ce, https://si.imgix.net/74a0c2eb/uploads/origins/318d2c77-a0c0-4693-a783-ce67d35d7cbf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e4d91b04b33db90a07ff339c65583c76 2x, https://si.imgix.net/74a0c2eb/uploads/origins/318d2c77-a0c0-4693-a783-ce67d35d7cbf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=650f54bf4c60f6ea36a458ed8b3e2db9 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/74a0c2eb/uploads/origins/318d2c77-a0c0-4693-a783-ce67d35d7cbf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7ba01a036e8f8f7ba007ca102357ca59", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/74a0c2eb/uploads/origins/318d2c77-a0c0-4693-a783-ce67d35d7cbf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7ba01a036e8f8f7ba007ca102357ca59, https://si.imgix.net/74a0c2eb/uploads/origins/318d2c77-a0c0-4693-a783-ce67d35d7cbf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=086ca866355a956ba33a35e7c1954383 2x, https://si.imgix.net/74a0c2eb/uploads/origins/318d2c77-a0c0-4693-a783-ce67d35d7cbf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a5b731466c55afd54c38520fc79c5d2a 3x"}, "body": "\u304a\u4e16\u8a71\u306b\u306a\u3063\u3066\u304a\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3001\u3044\u3064\u3082\u30a4\u30e9\u30b9\u30c8\u3082\u30dd\u30b9\u30c8\u3082\u697d\u3057\u304f\u62dd\u898b\u3055\u305b\u3066\u3044\u305f\u3060\u3044\u3066\u304a\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002\nameco\u3055\u3093\u306e\u63cf\u304b\u308c\u308b\u5973\u306e\u5b50\u304c\u3068\u3066\u3082\u53ef\u611b\u304f\u597d\u304d\u3067\u4eca\u56de\u30ea\u30af\u30a8\u30b9\u30c8\u3055\u305b\u3066\u3044\u305f\u3060\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3002\n\n\u65e9\u901f\u3067\u3059\u304c\u983c\u307f\u305f\u3044\u30ad\u30e3\u30e9\u30af\u30bf\u30fc\u306fURL\u5148\u306b\u8a18\u8f09\u306e\u30ad\u30e3\u30e9\u30af\u30bf\u30fc\u306b\u306a\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002 (Google\u30c9\u30e9\u30a4\u30d6\u306b\u307e\u3068\u3081\u3066\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059)\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1WV5rU2_QLxP_p61xGeZQbhw5Pf7K20N1?usp=share_link\n\n\n\u30a4\u30e9\u30b9\u30c8\u306e\u69cb\u56f3\u3084\u30b7\u30c1\u30e5\u30a8\u30fc\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u3001\u8868\u60c5\u306f\u304a\u4efb\u305b\u3044\u305f\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3001NG\u306a\u3069\u306f\u306a\u3044\u305f\u3081\u63cf\u304d\u3084\u3059\u3044\u3088\u3046\u306b\u63cf\u3044\u3066\u3044\u305f\u3060\u3051\u308c\u3070\u3068\u601d\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002 \n\n<\u30b5\u30a4\u30ba> \u30b5\u30a4\u30ba\u6307\u5b9a\u7121\u3057\n<\u5f62\u5f0f> JPEG \n<\u89e3\u50cf\u5ea6> 300\u301c350dpi \n<\u7528\u9014> SNS\u306a\u3069\u306e\u30a2\u30a4\u30b3\u30f3or\u30d8\u30c3\u30c0\u30fc\u3001\u30b9\u30de